# The T2 approval floor (dotfiles#967 slice 1, A5a). Shipped by the renovate-agent host
# component to /usr/lib/homelab/t2-approval-floor.
#
# Every T2 lander reads this one list: renovate-agent-land@ through renovate_floor.py, and a
# lander that sets LAND_APPROVAL_PATHS to this file through land_lib/policy.py. A PR changing
# a path under an entry needs the operator's approval of its head. Renovate's lander exempts a
# digest-only image bump; no other lander does.
#
# A plain entry is a path prefix. An entry holding `*` is a glob over the whole path, where
# `**` spans directories, so `**/conftest.py` matches one at any depth. Paths are listed on
# both sides of ADR 0030's rename, because the file is installed and outlives the tree it
# shipped in.
#
# homelab-claude-land@ (T1, the phone host's lander) reads its own narrower list,
# hosts/components/claude-code/templates/claude-land-approval-paths.j2.

# homelab-updater installs every host package as root, and builder/ and lib/ reach the
# archive signing key.
